  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engagement Facility &#x2013; Rapid and flexible technical assistance to support the implementation of Malaysia&#x2019;s Country Programme Action Plan (CPAP) 2024-2025 (EF-CPAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EF-CPAP is established as a rapid and flexible response mechanism to support the Government of Malaysia on upstream policy results, test innovation with scale-up potentials, policy impact and evaluation, and support results identified in the CPD and in the 12th Malaysia Plan. The EF-CPAP also intends to generate evidence and insights to inform forward looking agenda ie the new CPD and the 13th Malaysia Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
